      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, this is a really good start and very professional. i appreciate you not overdoing the headings like i asked.\n\nhowever, i just got word from the audit lead. they said the automated scan on the last batch of reports came back with \"insufficient structural granularity\" because the heading counts were too low. they're worried that if the score is too low, it'll trigger a manual deep-dive audit which we really want to avoid.\n\ncould you try a version that is a bit more... granular? i still need it to be a coherent, useful report and I really don't want you to just fragment things into nonsense or keyword-stuff, but we definitely need that `score = count_of_headings_used` to be higher so the automated tool clears it. maybe break down the requirements into more specific sub-sections?",
